  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      89.76,
      404.47,
      295.31,
      427.04
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.:Anu/ 4/5 /2/7 /3/81/1.Land Ministry Reference No.: 4/3/9/2014/WS/149.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      442.16,
      295.43,
      514.64
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub -section (1) of Section 07 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land requiredfor construction of Water Tank and Quarters under theAnuradhapura North Water Supply Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      529.51,
      223.13,
      539.6
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      548.96,
      295.28,
      634.16
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called Pihimbiyagollawa Mookalana,Kolongahawatta in total extent of 0.2023 Hectare depicted asLot No. 228 in Final Village Plan No. 580, prepared by thesurveyor - General in the village of Pihimbiyagollawa in GramaNiladhari Division of No.81 Pihimbiyagollawa , in DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Rambawa, Anuradhapura DistrictNorthern Central Province and bounded as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      649.08,
      295.16,
      671.64
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 228 - Name of the Land: PihimbiyagollawaMookalana, Kolongahawatta; Extent: 0.2023 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.44,
      359.84,
      547.6,
      383.12
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 227; East: Lot No. 230; South: Lot No. 230 andLot No. 229; West: Lot No. 229 and 227.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.44,
      398.72,
      547.68,
      526.64
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands, on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Divisional Secretariat Rambawa, on the 22nd day of June2017 at 10.00 O'clock, and are hereby requested to notify tome in writing (in duplicate) on or before 22nd day of June2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensation for the acquisition of the saidland, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
